# Feature Modules

- One BUILD_PLAN feature row per task; vertical slice (logic/view/tests/i18n)
- Thin wiring ≤10 lines in composition roots
- Sequential before Parallel; venue `[LOCAL]`/`[CLOUD]` + `— scope:`

After every AGENT step (scoped only — **do not** run full `watch-agent-gates` / full-suite pytest):

```bash
# Lint/format/type on touched paths, then pytest for the feature tests only, e.g.:
uv run ruff check <touched> && uv run ruff format --check <touched>
uv run mypy <touched-logic>   # when types changed
uv run pytest <feature-tests> -q --tb=short --no-cov
```

Exit 1 on scoped failures → autofix in scope (3-strike). Do not hang on full multi-stack feature-gate mid-slice.

Full local gates only when the human asks (`/gates`, `/fix`) or at ship/prerelease:

```bash
python3 scripts/agent-run.py watch-agent-gates --once --autofix --scope auto
```

After last `[AGENT]`/`[AUTO]` in the sprint is ✅:

```bash
python3 scripts/agent-run.py smoke-sprint --require
```

See `docs/FEATURE_MODULES.md` · `docs/SPRINT_SMOKE.md`.
